WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:02.402
Former President Donald

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:04.237
Trump is back on the campaign trail.

00:00:04.237 --> 00:00:05.972
And returning to a familiar playbook.

00:00:05.972 --> 00:00:07.073
Trump speech in Waco,

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:08.008
Texas, was littered

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:09.042
with his old lies

00:00:09.042 --> 00:00:10.777
about the 2020 election

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:12.045
and the border wall.

00:00:12.045 --> 00:00:12.512
Also,

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:13.513
some fresh attacks

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:15.949
on his current legal situation as

00:00:15.949 --> 00:00:16.683
he is facing

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:18.551
at least one possible indictment

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:19.085
that's looming

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:19.719
seen as Daniel

00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:21.921
Dale joins us now with a fact check.

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:23.123
Daniel, I guess, you know,

00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:24.491
one of the questions that we ask is

00:00:24.491 --> 00:00:25.158
where do we begin?

00:00:25.158 --> 00:00:26.192
Sometimes I feel like it's easier

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:28.028
to count the truths

00:00:28.028 --> 00:00:30.730
in his speech versus the lies but

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:32.065
where can you take us on this?

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:32.632
It can be

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:34.034
let's let's start this time

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:35.468
with a wildly exaggerated

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:37.037
figure that former President Trump

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:37.804
keeps using.

00:00:37.804 --> 00:00:39.672
Despite fact checks for me and others

00:00:39.672 --> 00:00:42.042
for the amount of military equipment

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:43.743
that was left to the Taliban upon

00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:45.512
the US withdrawal from Afghanistan.

00:00:45.512 --> 00:00:46.112
Listen to this.

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:49.382
We are

00:00:49.382 --> 00:00:49.983
a nation

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:52.385
that surrendered and Afghanistan,

00:00:53.019 --> 00:00:55.255
leaving behind dead soldiers,

00:00:55.655 --> 00:00:59.192
American citizens and $85 billion

00:00:59.192 --> 00:01:02.429
worth of the finest military equipment

00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:05.598
anywhere in the world.

00:01:05.698 --> 00:01:07.534
So that 85 billion figure

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:09.269
is not even close to true.

00:01:09.269 --> 00:01:09.936
The Pentagon

00:01:09.936 --> 00:01:10.970
has put the value

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:12.172
of that equipment left behind

00:01:12.172 --> 00:01:13.473
at about 7 billion.

00:01:13.473 --> 00:01:15.141
Independent experts have told me

00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:16.076
that makes sense.

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:18.011
So where does the 85 billion come from?

00:01:18.011 --> 00:01:19.612
Well, that is a rounded figure.

00:01:19.612 --> 00:01:21.214
It was actually about 83 billion

00:01:21.214 --> 00:01:22.749
for the total amount of money

00:01:22.749 --> 00:01:23.349
that Congress

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:24.250
appropriated

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:26.019
to the Afghan security forces

00:01:26.019 --> 00:01:27.720
over the entire course of the war.

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:29.189
Not even close to all that gym

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:30.857
was for equipment.

00:01:30.857 --> 00:01:31.958
Those things like salaries,

00:01:31.958 --> 00:01:33.726
like infrastructure, like training.

00:01:33.726 --> 00:01:34.994
About 19 billion

00:01:34.994 --> 00:01:37.530
in total was equipment, about 7 billion

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:38.498
left behind.

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:39.165
Now, I'm not saying

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:39.799
7 billion left

00:01:39.799 --> 00:01:40.567
behind is a good thing

00:01:40.567 --> 00:01:41.401
before I get angry

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:42.902
emails from Trump supporters.

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:44.471
But it's important for public figures

00:01:44.471 --> 00:01:45.472
to get their facts straight.

00:01:45.472 --> 00:01:45.705
All right.

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:47.107
And you might get those emails anyway,

00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:48.508
but Daniel,

00:01:48.508 --> 00:01:48.842
you know,

00:01:48.842 --> 00:01:50.910
Trump can't seem to get through the rally

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:52.078
these days

00:01:52.078 --> 00:01:53.913
without lying about the border wall.

00:01:53.913 --> 00:01:55.181
This is one that we've heard

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:56.282
time and again. Let's listen

00:01:58.251 --> 00:01:58.718
I built

00:01:58.718 --> 00:01:59.252
hundreds of

00:01:59.252 --> 00:02:01.588
miles of wall and completed that task

00:02:01.588 --> 00:02:02.722
totally as promised.

00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:04.357
And then I began to add

00:02:04.357 --> 00:02:06.126
even more wall in areas

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:07.994
where it was needed

00:02:08.428 --> 00:02:09.596
Let's fact check this one.

00:02:09.596 --> 00:02:10.530
I think I did this

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:12.532
after the last big Trump speech

00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:13.133
on your show.

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:14.400
So, yes, again,

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:15.301
former President Trump

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:17.003
did not finish the wall

00:02:17.003 --> 00:02:18.471
He essentially refutes his own statement

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:19.672
by saying it was finished

00:02:19.672 --> 00:02:20.807
and we were building more

00:02:20.807 --> 00:02:21.641
where it was needed.

00:02:21.641 --> 00:02:22.308
It was still

00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:22.976
it was still needed

00:02:22.976 --> 00:02:24.177
because it was not done.

00:02:24.177 --> 00:02:25.712
And we know this from official figures

00:02:25.712 --> 00:02:27.847
released by Customs and Border Protection

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:29.282
right after Trump left office.

00:02:29.282 --> 00:02:32.252
They said 480 miles had been constructed

00:02:32.352 --> 00:02:35.889
under Trump or sorry, a four, 458 miles

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:36.990
completed under Trump.

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:39.392
But 280 remaining miles

00:02:39.392 --> 00:02:40.293
had been identified

00:02:40.293 --> 00:02:42.562
for wall construction, but were not done.

00:02:42.562 --> 00:02:43.263
So having

00:02:43.263 --> 00:02:45.031
280 miles left to go

00:02:45.031 --> 00:02:46.432
is not even close to complete

00:02:46.432 --> 00:02:47.734
and Mexico never paid for it.

00:02:47.734 --> 00:02:48.301
For those of us

00:02:48.301 --> 00:02:50.203
who were old enough to remember that one

00:02:50.203 --> 00:02:51.404
and Trump references

00:02:51.404 --> 00:02:52.372
legal issues, here's

00:02:52.372 --> 00:02:53.339
what he had to say about that.

00:02:55.241 --> 00:02:57.310
Prosecutorial misconduct

00:02:57.310 --> 00:02:58.978
is their new tool,

00:02:58.978 --> 00:03:00.914
and they are willing to use it at levels

00:03:00.914 --> 00:03:02.949
never seen before.

00:03:02.949 --> 00:03:04.951
In our country, we've had it

00:03:04.951 --> 00:03:07.220
but we've never had it like this.

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:08.588
We must stop.

00:03:08.588 --> 00:03:09.989
What's the reality on this one?

00:03:09.989 --> 00:03:10.423
Look,

00:03:10.423 --> 00:03:12.592
we don't know a lot about

00:03:12.592 --> 00:03:13.826
the various investigations.

00:03:13.826 --> 00:03:14.861
They're shrouded in secrecy.

00:03:14.861 --> 00:03:15.728
I don't want to declare that

00:03:15.728 --> 00:03:17.063
they're perfect investigations,

00:03:17.063 --> 00:03:18.298
but there is no evidence

00:03:18.298 --> 00:03:20.633
of actual prosecutorial misconduct

00:03:20.633 --> 00:03:21.301
at this point.

00:03:21.301 --> 00:03:22.035
So we can't say

00:03:22.035 --> 00:03:23.403
the investigations were perfect.

00:03:23.403 --> 00:03:24.170
President Trump

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:26.105
cannot say with any evidence

00:03:26.105 --> 00:03:27.440
that there has been misconduct.

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:29.008
And indeed, when he makes these claims,

00:03:29.008 --> 00:03:30.076
he does not provide

00:03:30.076 --> 00:03:31.611
any specific corroboration,

00:03:31.611 --> 00:03:33.880
any specific proof for any misconduct.

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:36.015
By any of these prosecutors. Right.

00:03:36.015 --> 00:03:37.317
Which is what he always does.

00:03:37.317 --> 00:03:37.584
All right.

00:03:37.584 --> 00:03:39.219
Daniel Dale, thank you very much.

00:03:39.219 --> 00:03:39.919
We appreciate it.

